# What the migrate image's build may see (BuildKit reads this file in place of the root's
# .dockerignore for deploy/vps/migrate/Dockerfile): the migrations and this folder. An allowlist,
# so supabase/seed.sql, supabase/seeds/ and anything added at the root later never reach it.
*

!supabase/migrations/
!deploy/vps/migrate/

# Never an environment file, even inside an allowed folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
